Spec: Public contract conformance runner

Platform: C#/.NET10

Purpose:
  Compare the portable parser against shared exact-byte cases and observable immutability boundaries.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Contracts.Tests.csproj
  ./Program.cs

References:
  /contracts/vectors/cases.json
  /docs/adr/0001-public-contract-normalization.md

Must:
  Compare shared status/operation DTO cases and check their immutable public properties.
  Accept `--vectors` and `--output` paths and emit structural comparison results with `contractVersion`, `total`, `passed` and `cases`.
  Exit nonzero on mismatches without logging rejected payloads.
  Verify public values have no public setters and exposed collections reject modification.
  Verify validation exceptions do not reflect a supplied simulated private marker.
  Compare connection request parsing and policy narrowing against the shared request cases, including well-formed requests that exceed approved constraints.

Done when:
  The shared corpus passes and local boundary checks complete.
